            "title": "TSX強勢股：VersaBank飆漲10%，企業利多消息推動領漲個股表現亮眼",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"TSX強勢股：VersaBank飆漲10%，企業利多消息推動領漲個股表現亮眼\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7e0548bf673dc60a15074372c8a80622443a14dffa18a03f1aa835b6f86e6918/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2Fbull_b_5._M_1440048196.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">TSX強勢股：VersaBank飆漲10%，企業利多消息推動領漲個股表現亮眼</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 週五，受企業利多消息及分析師評級上調提振，多隻加拿大股票吸引強勁買盤，其中VersaBank大漲近10%，領跑多倫多證券交易所（TSX）漲幅榜，5N Plus及漢蒙電力解決方案（Hammond Power Solutions）亦錄得可觀升幅。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>強勢上漲個股</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">以下為今日TSX漲幅居前個股及其主要數據：</p><table class=\"bodyBlock-table w-full border-collapse mb-module-gap\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">股票代碼</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">股價</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">今日漲跌幅</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">近一年回報</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">分析師目標價上行空間</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">要點</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">VersaBank</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">C$22.51</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">9.8%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">72.7%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">-0.3%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國業務重組特別股東大會成為催化劑</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">5N Plus Inc</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">C$18.96</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">5.0%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] br